  "description": "Han Garam enrolls in a prestigious arts university at the heart of Korea's classical music scene, an institution that has produced world-renowned musicians. His academic advisor, Professor Kim Heejae, a world-famous pianist, exploits Han Garam's passion for his own ambition... \"what you hold dearest will become your greatest pain.\"\n\nPre-serialization    \n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/no_eurydice) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://www.cmoa.jp/title/298190/)",
